            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 76, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 22px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>两种做法都不建立"自动跟随最新版"的关系：明确修改了哪份内容，旧结果仍然对应旧输入。</Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>5.9 迭代与维护</Text>
